-- ============================================================
-- Online Tools Platform — Dummy/Seed Data
-- ============================================================
-- Import AFTER schema.sql, via phpMyAdmin's Import tab or:
--   mysql -u youruser -p your_database < database/seed.sql
--
-- Contains exactly what database/seed.php also inserts (this file
-- was generated by actually running seed.php against a real database
-- and dumping the result, so it's guaranteed consistent with it):
--   - 1 admin account:  admin@example.com / ChangeMe123!
--                       CHANGE THIS PASSWORD IMMEDIATELY AFTER IMPORT.
--   - Default site settings (name, tagline, disclaimer, etc.)
--   - 12 categories
--   - 55 tools, each with content, formulas, FAQs, examples, related
--     tools, and SEO fields
--   - 7 static pages (About, Contact, Privacy, Terms, Disclaimer,
--     Cookie Policy, FAQ)
--
-- The public route files these tools/categories/pages need
-- (e.g. salary-calculator.php, corporate-office-tools.php) are
-- already included as real files in this project — you do not need
-- to run database/seed.php or any script to create them; this SQL
-- file only needs to populate the database.
--
-- Safe to import into a fresh database created from schema.sql. Do
-- NOT import this into a database that already has rows in these
-- tables — it will fail on duplicate primary keys / unique slugs
-- rather than silently overwrite anything.
-- ============================================================
SET NAMES utf8mb4;
SET FOREIGN_KEY_CHECKS = 0;


SET FOREIGN_KEY_CHECKS = 1;
